    "detail": "Proclamation 11020. Subject Ch.29/30 classifications per U.S. note 40(c). Generics not subject to additional duties (9903.04.67). UK patented articles report 9903.04.63 — rate reduced from 10% additional to 0% effective 2026-07-31 (CSMS #69415934).",
    "notes": [
      "Effective 2026-07-31 all importers of subject Ch.29/30 goods must report an applicable 9903.04.60–.69 heading even when the rate is 0%.",
      "FTA / SPI special rates: duties under 9903.04.60–.68 are collected in addition to any special Column-1 rate (CSMS #69395344) — SPI does not clear this 232 layer.",
      "When a 9903.04.60–.66 patented-pharma heading applies, 301-FL is in the Section 232 universe → report 9903.05.90 (Note 52(f))."
    ]
  },
